    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25558" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπλίσσομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stand</i> or <i>walk with the legs apart,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπεπλιγμένος</span>”
				<i>long-shanked, straddling,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					58
				</span></i>
			: so in pf.
			part.
			
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμα διαπεπλῐχός</span>”
				<i>wide open,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.167
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, and v. foreg.</div>
